// ============================================================
// WHAT: Builds INSERT query for voice_latency_metrics table.
// WHY:  Per-request timing breakdown enables Grafana dashboards,
//       A/B model comparisons, regression detection, and
//       fine-tune impact measurement. See Spec Section 7.
// ============================================================

