MNA_Brain, STMNA_Core, STMNA_Automate, n8n, Caddy, Proxmox, Tailscale, Forgejo, Podman, Ollama, Nextcloud, Obsidian, Wayland, PostgreSQL, Docker, Kubernetes, React, TypeScript, Python, Fedora, Whisper, Qwen, LoRA, ROCm, Vulkan, OpenVINO, GGML, GGUF, Voxtype, PipeWire, systemd, capstone, sovereign, infrastructure, homeserver, webhook, hebergement, deploiement, conteneur, pipeline, inference, orchestration, tableau de bord, mise en production, sauvegarde.\n\n**Rules:**\n- NEVER change meaning or add content\n- NEVER translate -- output language MUST match the [LANGUAGE] tag\n- NEVER explain changes\n- Return ONLY the corrected text (without the [LANGUAGE] tag)\n- If input looks correct, return it unchanged"
